## 8. Backend API (FastAPI) — รายละเอียด

### 8.1 API Architecture

```
backend/
├── api/
│   ├── main.py                 # FastAPI app + lifespan (model loading)
│   ├── dependencies.py         # Dependency injection (DB, Models)
│   └── routes/
│       ├── stocks.py           # Stock data CRUD
│       ├── funds.py            # Fund NAV & holdings
│       ├── predictions.py      # ML prediction endpoints
│       ├── portfolio.py        # Portfolio optimization
│       ├── backtest.py         # Backtesting endpoints
│       └── system.py           # Health check, system info
├── config/
│   └── settings.py             # Pydantic BaseSettings
├── data/
│   ├── collector.py
│   ├── preprocessor.py
│   └── storage.py
├── features/
│   └── technical_indicators.py
├── models/
│   ├── lstm_model.py
│   ├── xgboost_model.py
│   ├── ensemble.py
│   └── trainer.py
├── portfolio/
│   └── optimizer.py
├── backtest/
│   └── engine.py               # Backtesting simulation engine
├── schemas/
│   └── api_schemas.py          # Pydantic request/response models
└── requirements.txt
```

### 8.2 Full API Specification

| Route | Method | Request | Response | Description |
|-------|--------|---------|----------|-------------|
| `/api/health` | GET | — | `{status, version, uptime}` | Health check |
| `/api/stocks` | GET | `?sector=` | `[{symbol, name, sector}]` | รายชื่อหุ้นทั้งหมด |
| `/api/stocks/{symbol}/prices` | GET | `?start=&end=` | `[{date, O,H,L,C,V}]` | ราคาย้อนหลัง |
| `/api/stocks/{symbol}/indicators` | GET | `?indicators=rsi,macd` | `[{date, rsi, macd, ...}]` | Technical indicators |
| `/api/stocks/collect` | POST | `{symbols[], period}` | `{status, count}` | Trigger data collection |
| `/api/funds` | GET | — | `[{name, style, holdings}]` | รายชื่อกองทุน |
| `/api/funds/{name}/nav` | GET | `?start=&end=` | `[{date, nav, return}]` | NAV history |
| `/api/predictions/{symbol}` | GET | `?model=ensemble&days=5` | `{predictions[], confidence, signal}` | ผลพยากรณ์ |
| `/api/predictions/train` | POST | `{symbols[], model_type}` | `{status, metrics}` | Train models |
| `/api/portfolio/optimize` | POST | `{symbols[], method, risk_level}` | `{weights[], metrics, frontier[]}` | Optimize portfolio |
| `/api/backtest/run` | POST | `{symbol, model, period}` | `{trades[], metrics}` | Run backtest |
| `/api/models/performance` | GET | — | `{models: [{name, rmse, mape, ...}]}` | Model metrics |
| `/api/models/features/{symbol}` | GET | — | `[{feature, importance}]` | Feature importance |

### 8.3 Pydantic Schemas (ตัวอย่าง)

```python
class StockPrice(BaseModel):
    date: date
    open: float
    high: float
    low: float
    close: float
    volume: int

class PredictionResponse(BaseModel):
    symbol: str
    model: str
    predictions: list[PredictionPoint]
    signal: Literal["BUY", "SELL", "HOLD"]
    confidence: float  # 0-100%
    metrics: ModelMetrics

class PortfolioRequest(BaseModel):
    symbols: list[str]
    method: Literal["max_sharpe", "min_volatility", "risk_parity"]
    risk_level: float = 0.5  # 0-1 slider

class PortfolioResponse(BaseModel):
    weights: dict[str, float]
    expected_return: float
    volatility: float
    sharpe_ratio: float
    frontier: list[FrontierPoint]
```

### 8.4 Model Loading Strategy
- โหลด trained models ตอน **app startup** ผ่าน FastAPI lifespan
- เก็บใน memory → inference เร็ว (no disk I/O per request)
- ถ้า model ยังไม่มี → return warning + ให้ user train ก่อน

